          }
        },
        "heading_mW3fdR": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<strong>Customization For A Special Moment</strong>",
            "heading_tag": "h2"
          }
        },
        "richtext_8KGmgJ": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>Some occasions need flowers that feel personal. Our custom floral service lets you choose the colors, size, and style that fit your vision. Our arrangements are done with expertise to reflect the mood and meaning behind your gesture. </p><p><strong>Popular custom designs include:</strong></p><ul><li><a href=\"/collections/wedding\" title=\"Wedding\"><strong>Wedding Florals</strong></a><strong>:</strong> Elegant centrepieces, bouquets, and ceremony blooms</li><li><a href=\"/collections/anniversaries\" title=\"Anniversaries\"><strong>Anniversary Gifts:</strong></a> Romantic arrangements that speak without words</li><li><a href=\"/collections/birthday\" title=\"Birthday\"><strong>Birthday Bouquets:</strong></a> Bright, joyful pieces made to surprise</li><li><strong>Corporate Flowers:</strong> Refined designs for offices and client gifts</li><li><a href=\"/pages/sympathy\" title=\"Sympathy\"><strong>Sympathy Arrangements</strong></a><strong>:</strong> Gentle tributes offering comfort</li><li><strong>Seasonal Designs:</strong> Festive florals for holidays and Hermosa Beach events</li></ul>"
          }
        },
        "button_x93itq": {
          "type": "button",
          "settings": {
