    "image_with_text_NYCDr8": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_cPtVPy": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<strong>Online Ordering & Same-Day Flower Delivery Hermosa Beach CA</strong>",
            "heading_tag": "h2"
          }
        },
        "richtext_VrdfJf": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>Sending flowers is quick and easy. Our <strong>Hermosa Beach flower delivery service</strong> lets you browse, select, and order online in just a few clicks. We deliver to homes, offices, hotels, and event spaces across Hermosa Beach, CA, making sure every bouquet arrives fresh, on time, and in perfect condition. </p><p><em>Need flowers today? Our </em><a href=\"/pages/contact\" title=\"Contact\"><em>same-day delivery</em></a><em> ensures your gift reaches its destination quickly, brightening any occasion without stress.</em></p>"
