          "settings": {
            "text": "<strong>Why We Stand Out in Hermosa Beach</strong>",
            "heading_tag": "h2"
          }
        },
        "richtext_yB3EtJ": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>Our dedication to quality, creativity, and customer satisfaction sets us apart from other flower shops in Hermosa Beach, CA. From the first order to regular delivery, we make each experience memorable.</p><h3><strong>Experienced Florists</strong></h3><ul><li>Skilled local florists with years of expertise</li><li>Designs that balance creativity and elegance</li><li>Attention to detail in every arrangement</li></ul><h3><strong>Affordable Options</strong></h3><ul><li>Beautiful arrangements to suit all budgets</li><li>Value without compromising quality</li><li>Seasonal promotions and special offers</li></ul><h3><strong>Weekly/Monthly Subscriptions</strong></h3><ul><li>Regular flower delivery for homes or offices</li><li>Customizable frequency and bouquet style</li><li>Convenient, hassle-free service</li></ul><h3><strong>Seasonal & Trendy Designs</strong></h3><ul><li>Rotating collections to match seasons and holidays</li><li>Modern, classic, and natural styles</li><li>Keeps your home or event on-trend with the latest floral designs</li></ul>"
          }
        },
